oad, in August 1958, his team began to study the phenoxy acids, the line of work that led to ibuprofen.[^wiki] The day nursery on the corner of Oakfields Road and Rutland Road was also part of Boots.[^lb]","source":{"title":"Boots: structural (Nottinghamshire Heritage Gateway)","url":"http://www.nottsheritagegateway.org.uk/themes/boots/bootsstructural.htm","kind":"nottsheritagegateway.org.uk","read":"2026-11-27"},"cites":{"gateway":{"title":"Boots: structural (Nottinghamshire Heritage Gateway)","url":"http://www.nottsheritagegateway.org.uk/themes/boots/bootsstructural.htm","kind":"nottsheritagegateway.org.uk","read":"2026-11-27"},"boots":{"title":"Boots Hidden Heroes: honouring Dr Stewart Adams (Boots UK)","url":"https://www.boots-uk.com/newsroom/features/boots-hidden-heroes-honouring-dr-stewart-adams/","kind":"Boots UK","read":"2026-11-27"},"odnb":{"title":"Adams, Stewart Sanders (1923–2019) (Oxford Dictionary of National Biography)","url":"https://www.oxforddnb.com/display/10.1093/ref:odnb/9780198614128.001.0001/odnb-9780198614128-e-90000380825","kind":"oxforddnb.com","read":"2026-11-27"},"wiki":{"title":"Stewart Adams (chemist)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stewart_Adams_(chemist)","kind":"Wikipedia"},"lb":{"title":"A brief history of Lady Bay, Pat Rodriguez and others","url":"https://sites.create-cdn.net/sitefiles/58/1/2/581262/A_Brief_History_of_Lady_Bay_-_Pat_Rodriguez.pdf","kind":"sites.create-cdn.net","read":"2026-11-27"}},"when":"1920","whenSrc":{"title":"Boots: structural (Nottinghamshire Heritage Gateway)","url":"http://www.nottsheritagegateway.org.uk/themes/boots/bootsstructural.htm","kind":"nottsheritagegateway.org.uk","read":"2026-11-27"},"nm":"Boots' research houses, West Bridgford","see":[["Penicillin at Daleside Road, 1944","p690"],["Ibuprofen","300083"],["Stewart Adams","who"]]}],"sum":"The Wishing Well Day Nursery is a nursery on Oakfields Road.","sumSrc":{"title":"OpenStreetMap","kind":"Written from the map's data"},"council":"Rushcliffe 